# specfold

- Edit rules, decisions and plans only as typed documents under `.spec/`.
- Create a document with `spec new <type> --title "..." --slug ... --write`.
- Change status only with `spec set <id> status=... --write`.
- `spec check` must pass before a commit.
- `docs/` and `README.md` are for humans. Do not paste a SoT body into them.
- Write every new document in English.
